<title>UK: Laura Ashley store sales up 7 pct in H2.</title>
<headline>Laura Ashley store sales up 7 pct in H2.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laura Ashley Holdings Plc said total turnover in its shops was up seven percent on a like-for-like basis in the first seven weeks of the second half of its current financial year.</p>
</text>
